Package: store.nguyennt.hmaheapfix
Name: HMA Startup Fix
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: NguyenNT <nguyennt-devops@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<< 17.0), ldid, coreutils, findutils
Description: Fix Go heap startup crash in HMA VPN 6.0.1 (13689)
 Requires an existing HMA VPN installation with the supported framework hash.
 Applies a scoped low-address heap reservation fix and saves an original backup.
 Removing this package restores the original framework when it has not changed.
 Verified on palera1n rootless, iPhone 8, iOS 16.7.16. Other devices unverified.
 VPN tunnel extension is not modified; VPN connection has not been verified.
Homepage: https://github.com/nguyennt-devops/nchanger-apt
Depiction: https://repo.nguyennt.store/repo/hma-startup-fix.html
